From: Selim Bucher <me@selim.one>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.ui.notifications: Add stub ToastNotificationManager, ToastNotification and XmlDocument factories.

Adobe Creative Cloud desktop creates a toast notifier at startup and
dereferences the factory without checking RoGetActivationFactory's result,
so a missing Windows.UI.Notifications runtime crashed it on launch.
Nothing is displayed; Show() succeeds silently.

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -3392,6 +3392,7 @@
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windows.system.profile.systemmanufacturers/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windows.ui.core.textinput)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windows.ui.core.textinput/tests)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windows.ui.notifications)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windows.ui.xaml)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windows.ui.xaml/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windows.ui)
